      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "THE TORQUE EFFECT (4) has been close to the mark of late and again performed admirably last start, making a long run from a fair way out but finding a couple better over 2040m at this track. Good enough to take out a race like this. CALL KELLY (9) had to call on all reserves to salute last time out over 1780m at this track, getting home by just 1.5 metres. No favours expected from this draw. Won't find this any harder and she can salute once again. DIAMANTINA DAISY (1) didn't do a bad job when fourth over 1780m at this track last time out. REAL MIKI (2) is heading the right way, improving last time out to finish third at this track over 2040m.",
